	(text "RECEIVER: VCC + V_IO tied to +3.3V; VIO_SEL open = 3.3 V I/O (IM 4.1.2).\nC43/C44 beside pins 7/8, short GND vias; no series R > 0.2 ohm in VCC (IM 4.1.1).\nRESET_N, EXTINT, SDA, SCL, SAFEBOOT_N, LNA_EN left open (DS Table 10).\nPPS: TIMEPULSE = SAFEBOOT_N via 1k inside (DS fn 15); nothing may hold it\nlow at power-up, so no pull-down. R42 limits a shorted J14 to ~7 mA (I_PIO 10 mA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 167.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7c184d40-c8f0-4270-8e6d-f90b073bbd83")
	)
	(text "ANTENNA: RF_IN is DC-blocked inside the module (IM Table 1), no external DC block.\nBias-T VCC_RF -> R40 10R -> C45 10n -> L3 27 nH onto RF line (IM 4.3.4, Tables 52-54).\nLayout: 50 ohm CPWG pin 11 -> J15, L3 pad on the line, >= 5 mm from digital.\nBACKUP: D13 + R41 charge C47 to ~2.9 V, D13 blocks back-feed; C46 1u at pin 6\nfor the switch-over peak (IM 4.1.3). ~2.7 h hold at 28 uA (DS Table 17)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
