	(text "[ ] C47: no stocked supercap at JLC/LCSC;\n     EECS0HD224H is THT, hand-solder, no footprint.\n[ ] Antenna short: 3.2 V / 10R = 320 mA,\n     above VCC_RF 250 mA abs max; no supervisor.\n[ ] V_IO ramp 25-35000 us/V (DS 4.1):\n     measure LP2985 start-up.\n[ ] +3.3V budget: GPS inrush 100 mA,\n     LP2985 peak ~145 of 150 mA.\n[ ] GPS_PPS MCU pin: A PC2 (move LED),\n     B PC3 (drop D10), C PD0-PD2."
